WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.769
In this video, you will tour your profile: your saved drafts, your contests, the badges your home has won, and your account settings.

00:00:07.769 --> 00:00:08.869
We start on the map.

00:00:09.772 --> 00:00:13.834
To begin, open your web browser, and go to SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:15.959
That is the only address you need.

00:00:17.673 --> 00:00:20.079
This is the SoCal Lights home page.

00:00:20.079 --> 00:00:23.823
The first time you visit, it asks to use your location.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.161
Tap Use my location.

00:00:26.904 --> 00:00:31.342
That is how the map shows how far things are, and gives you directions.

00:00:31.342 --> 00:00:34.546
Your browser asks permission as well, so tap Allow.

00:00:34.546 --> 00:00:39.107
Your location is used only on your device, and you can say no at any time.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:44.904
Your profile is one tap from the map.

00:00:44.904 --> 00:00:49.512
Look at the top of the map, and tap the person icon, next to the three dots.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:56.984
Drafts lists anything you started and saved, like an event or a contest you did not finish.

00:00:56.984 --> 00:01:01.597
Because it is saved to your account, you can finish it later, on any device.

00:01:03.172 --> 00:01:04.040
Tap Contests.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:14.948
This lists the contests you run, with buttons to manage each one or view its page, and below that, the homes you entered in other people's contests, with where each one stands.

00:01:16.826 --> 00:01:17.548
Tap Badges.

00:01:17.548 --> 00:01:21.942
When your home wins a contest, it earns a badge, and a crown on the map.

00:01:21.942 --> 00:01:25.914
All the awards your home has won are listed here, from every year.

00:01:27.791 --> 00:01:28.515
Tap Account.

00:01:28.515 --> 00:01:36.260
This is where you change your name and photo, and where you can delete your account, along with everything tied to it, if you ever want to.

00:01:38.041 --> 00:01:42.606
That is your profile: your drafts, your contests, your badges, and your account.

00:01:42.606 --> 00:01:48.750
If you ever need help, there is a Help Center in the menu, with written steps for everything in these videos.

00:01:50.158 --> 00:01:52.078
Next up: Vote in a contest.
